Tidy: cleaning and repair of HTML documents with libtidy (tidy-html5)
of the package az.

The module tidy of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20220829/tidy.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its headers in
include/php82/php/ext/tidy.
